jobs.description:
As an employee within the MCFW (MultiClientFulfillmentWarehouse) department, you and your colleagues are responsible for processing goods for various customers. You may work within MCFW, where smaller products such as mobile phones are handled, or within the Chiq department, where larger appliances such as washing machines and refrigerators are processed. Together with your team, you ensure that orders are handled accurately and dispatched on time.

Your tasks include:

• Checking incoming goods;
• Picking orders using a scanner;
• Packing customer orders;
• Processing returned orders and preparing them for shipment again;
• Working closely with colleagues to ensure efficient logistics processes;
• Helping maintain a clean and organized workplace at the end of the shift.
Ready to get started in a logistics role where accuracy and teamwork are key? Apply today and join the team in Bleiswijk.

Functie-eisen:
You are accurate, proactive, and enjoy working together with colleagues. You quickly learn new systems and administrative processes and feel comfortable in a logistics environment where quality and efficiency are important. You take responsibility for your work and make sure tasks are completed correctly.

In addition, you meet the following requirements:

• You are fluent in Dutch or English;
• You are available for afternoon and evening shifts from 1:00 PM to 9:30 PM or 2:30 PM to 11:00 PM;
• You are willing to work occasional weekends;
• You have good computer skills.

Together with your colleagues, you ensure that goods are processed efficiently and accurately throughout the warehouse. You contribute to a safe and organised working environment while helping maintain a smooth flow of products.

• Loading and unloading trucks;
• Sorting goods and shipments;
• Picking orders;
• Packing and preparing orders for shipment;
• Processing incoming and outgoing goods;
• Checking products for quality and quantity;
• Maintaining a safe, clean and organised workplace;
• Supporting the efficient handling of daily logistics operations.

Functie-eisen:
This position is suitable for someone who enjoys physical work and feels comfortable in a warehouse environment. You work carefully, take responsibility for the quality of your work and are willing to work different shifts.

For this position:

• You have MBO-level working and thinking ability through education or experience;
• Experience in logistics is an advantage;
• You are physically fit and willing to perform manual tasks;
• You work accurately and pay attention to quality;
• You are flexible and willing to work in a 4-shift system;
• You have a good command of either Dutch or English;
• You preferably live within 25 kilometres of the work location and have your own transportation.
